    "title": "One sentence, one trial for MC burglary that resulted in gunfire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Bunge ,\n13 hours ago MASON CITY, Iowa - A burglary that led to a shooting has resulted in one conviction so far. Michael Joseph Orozco, 36 of Mason City, was charged with second-degree burglary and Cody Dean Dakin, 31 of Mason City, was accused of possession of a firearm by a felon for the incident on October 27, 2025. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
